{"term": {"label": "信", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-ii", "title": "梁惠王下", "description": "莊暴見孟子，曰：「暴見於王，王語暴以好樂，暴未有以對也。」曰：「好樂何如？」\n孟子曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊國其庶幾乎！」\n他日，見於王曰：「王嘗語莊子以好樂，有諸？」王變乎色，曰：「寡人非能好先王之樂也，直好世俗之樂耳。」\n曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊其庶幾乎！今之樂猶古之樂也。」曰：「可得聞與？」\n曰：「獨樂樂，與人樂樂，孰", "occurrences": 1, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "保", "id": "保"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "告", "id": "吿"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "安", "id": "安"}, {"form": "怒", "id": "怒"}, {"form": "憂", "id": "憂"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "畏", "id": "畏"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "臣", "id": "臣"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "里", "id": "里"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.5052155108752239, "source": "行", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 2.209963603113649, "source": "行", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 1.9127120796457175, "source": "聞", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 2.066862759472976, "source": "聞", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 0.767579775342715, "source": "聞", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 1.9127120796457175, "source": "聞", "target": "里"}, {"weight": 1.556037135706985, "source": "聞", "target": "畏"}, {"weight": 3.070164868336761, "source": "安", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 3.676300671907076, "source": "安", "target": "怒"}, {"weight": 2.034072936649985, "source": "安", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 0.9354606479818752, "source": "憂", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 1.9715525796686508, "source": "憂", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 1.1242547192814474, "source": "里", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 1.7303905228517629, "source": "里", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 1.5762398430245046, "source": "里", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 1.9127120796457175, "source": "里", "target": "畏"}, {"weight": 1.2784053991087057, "source": "政", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 1.7303905228517629, "source": "政", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 2.3770176877768154, 